                <div><span>SMEs Registered</span><strong>12K+ Brands</strong></div>
                <div><span>Load Time</span><strong>1.1s</strong></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </a>

          <a href="https://www.ayojelajah.id/" target="_blank" class="web-portfolio-card">
