              </div>
            </div>
          </a>

          <a href="https://www.ayotekno.id/" target="_blank" class="web-portfolio-card">
            <div class="web-preview-header tekno">
              <span class="web-logo">Ayo<span class="hl">Tekno</span>.id</span>
              <span class="web-tag tag-tech">Technology</span>
            </div>
            <div class="web-info">
              <h3>AyoTekno.id</h3>
              <p>Media berita teknologi, review gadget terbaru, berita game, dan tutorial komputasi modern yang dioptimasi penuh untuk monetisasi iklan.</p>
              <div class="web-metrics">
                <div><span>Uptime</span><strong>99.99%</strong></div>
                <div><span>Monthly Traffic</span><strong>1.5M+ Views</strong></div>
                <div><span>Load Time</span><strong>0.7s</strong></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div> -->

      <!-- TAB 2: MOBILE APPLICATION (WOW BEKASI SIMULATOR) -->
      <div class="tab-content active" id="tab-mobile">
        <div class="app-showcase-layout">
          <div class="app-showcase-description">
            <div class="showcase-badge cyan">App Development Case Study</div>
            <h3>WOW Bekasi Mobile Portal</h3>
            <p class="desc-para">
              Aplikasi mobile terintegrasi yang dirancang khusus untuk mendukung
              inisiatif Smart City Kota Bekasi. Menampilkan panduan pariwisata,
              booklet visual 5 tahun pencapaian kota, akses layanan publik,
              serta direktori lokal secara real-time.
            </p>
            <div class="desc-bullets">
              <div class="desc-bullet-item">
                <span class="bullet-check">✓</span>
                <div>
                  <strong>Aplikasi Skala Publik & Pemerintahan</strong>
                  <p>
                    Kehandalan tinggi yang aman diakses oleh ratusan ribu warga
                    Kota Bekasi.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="desc-bullet-item">
                <span class="bullet-check">✓</span>
                <div>
                  <strong>Booklet & Majalah Digital Interaktif</strong>
                  <p>
                    Memiliki visualisasi booklet yang mulus, responsif, dan
                    mudah dibaca.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="app-simulation-control">
              <p>Gunakan simulator di samping untuk berpindah layar:</p>
              <div class="sim-btns">
                <button class="sim-btn active" id="btn-show-splash"
                  >Layar Splash (WOW Bekasi)</button
                >
                <button class="sim-btn" id="btn-show-booklet"
                  >Layar Booklet (Majalah Digital)</button
                >
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="app-simulator-container">
            <!-- Mobile Phone Frame Mockup -->
            <div class="smartphone-frame">
              <div class="smartphone-screen">
                <div class="phone-notch"></div>
                <div class="phone-status-bar">
                  <span>11:47</span>
                  <span class="icons">0.59K/d 🔋 84%</span>
                </div>

                <!-- APP SCREEN 1: SPLASH SCREEN (WOW BEKASI) -->
                <div class="app-screen-content active" id="screen-splash">
                  <Image
                    src={bekasiSplashImg}
                    alt="Wow Bekasi Splash"
                    class="app-screen-img"
                  />
                </div>

                <!-- APP SCREEN 2: BOOKLET SCREEN (WOW BEKASI ACHIEVEMENTS) -->
                <div class="app-screen-content" id="screen-booklet">
                  <Image
                    src={bekasiBookletImg}
                    alt="Wow Bekasi Booklet"
                    class="app-screen-img"
                  />
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="phone-home-indicator"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- TAB 3: SAAS & PLATFORM RISET -->
      <div class="tab-content" id="tab-saas">
        <!-- Sub-selector for SaaS platforms -->
        <div class="saas-platform-selector">
          <button class="saas-plat-btn active" data-saas-platform="gravspace">
            GravSpace Console
          </button>
          <button class="saas-plat-btn" data-saas-platform="nursynapse">
            Nursynapse (EdTech BIMA)
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Platform 1: GravSpace Console -->
        <div class="saas-showcase-layout active" id="saas-gravspace-layout">
          <div class="saas-showcase-description">
            <div class="showcase-badge purple">SaaS Enterprise Platform</div>
            <h3>GravSpace Console</h3>
            <p class="desc-para">
              Konsol manajemen S3 tingkat lanjut berkecepatan tinggi yang
              dirancang untuk arsitektur cloud korporat. Memberikan statistik
              kapasitas logikal, analitik bucket, live audit log, dan IAM engine
              terenkripsi.
            </p>
            <div class="saas-nav-simulator">
              <p>Simulasi Navigasi Konsol:</p>
              <div class="saas-tabs-btns">
                <button class="saas-tab-btn" id="saas-btn-signin"
                  >1. Layar Sign-in (Enkripsi)</button
                >
                <button class="saas-tab-btn active" id="saas-btn-dash"
                  >2. Dashboard Analitik</button
                >
                <button class="saas-tab-btn" id="saas-btn-buckets"
                  >3. Manajemen Bucket S3</button
                >
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="tech-spec-grid">
              <div class="spec-item">
                <span>Teknologi</span>
                <strong>Astro & Node.js</strong>
              </div>
              <div class="spec-item">
                <span>Enkripsi</span>
                <strong>AES-256 + S3 IAM</strong>
              </div>
              <div class="spec-item">
                <span>Skalabilitas</span>
                <strong>Multi-Region Cluster</strong>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="saas-link-wrapper" style="margin-top: 24px;">
              <a
                href="https://github.com/GravSpace/GravSpace"
                target="_blank"
                class="github-link"
              >
                <svg
                  class="github-icon"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                >
                  <path
                    d="M9 19c-5 1.5-5-2.5-7-3m14 6v-3.87a3.37 3.37 0 0 0-.94-2.61c3.14-.35 6.44-1.54 6.44-7A5.44 5.44 0 0 0 20 4.77 5.07 5.07 0 0 0 19.91 1S18.73.65 16 2.48a13.38 13.38 0 0 0-7 0C6.27.65 5.09 1 5.09 1A5.07 5.07 0 0 0 5 4.77a5.44 5.44 0 0 0-1.5 3.78c0 5.42 3.3 6.61 6.44 7A3.37 3.37 0 0 0 9 18.13V22"
                  ></path>
                </svg>
                <span>Lihat di GitHub</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="saas-simulator-container">
            <!-- Simulated Laptop Mockup Frame -->
            <div class="laptop-frame">
              <div class="laptop-screen">
                <!-- SCREEN 1: SIGN IN (GRAVSPACE) -->
                <div class="saas-screen-content" id="saas-screen-signin">
                  <Image
                    src={gravspaceSigninImg}
                    alt="GravSpace Sign In"
                    class="saas-screen-img"
                  />
                </div>

                <!-- SCREEN 2: DASHBOARD (GRAVSPACE) -->
                <div class="saas-screen-content active" id="saas-screen-dash">
                  <Image
                    src={gravspaceDashboardImg}
                    alt="GravSpace Dashboard"
                    class="saas-screen-img"
                  />
                </div>

                <!-- SCREEN 3: BUCKET LISTS (GRAVSPACE) -->
                <div class="saas-screen-content" id="saas-screen-buckets">
                  <Image
                    src={gravspaceBucketsImg}
                    alt="GravSpace Buckets"
                    class="saas-screen-img"
                  />
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Platform 2: Nursynapse Platform -->
        <div class="saas-showcase-layout" id="saas-nursynapse-layout">
          <div class="saas-showcase-description">
            <div class="showcase-badge teal">Pilot Project Hibah Riset</div>
            <h3>Nursynapse</h3>
            <p class="desc-para">
              Platform cerdas untuk pendidikan keperawatan yang mengintegrasikan
              kurikulum nasional dengan teknologi pembelajaran modern untuk
              menghadirkan pengalaman belajar personal, klinis, dan terukur.
            </p>

            <div class="desc-bullets text-left" style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
              <div class="desc-bullet-item">
                <span
                  class="bullet-check"
                  style="background: rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.1); color: #14b8a6;"
                  >✓</span
                >
                <div>
                  <strong>Kurikulum Standar PPNI</strong>
                  <p>
                    Materi pembelajaran dan evaluasi yang diselaraskan langsung
                    dengan standar nasional keperawatan.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="desc-bullet-item">
                <span
                  class="bullet-check"
                  style="background: rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.1); color: #14b8a6;"
                  >✓</span
                >
                <div>
                  <strong>Hibah Penelitian BIMA 2026</strong>
                  <p>
                    Dikembangkan sebagai pilot project inovasi pendidikan
                    keperawatan berlisensi resmi kementerian.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="tech-spec-grid">
              <div class="spec-item">
                <span>Program Hibah</span>
                <strong>BIMA 2026</strong>
              </div>
              <div class="spec-item">
                <span>Tipe Proyek</span>
                <strong>Pilot Riset</strong>
              </div>
              <div class="spec-item">
                <span>Metodologi</span>
                <strong>Evidence-Based</strong>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="saas-simulator-container">
            <!-- Simulated Laptop Mockup Frame -->
            <div class="laptop-frame">
              <div class="laptop-screen">
                <div class="saas-screen-content active">
                  <Image
                    src={nursynapseImg}
                    alt="Nursynapse Platform"
                    class="saas-screen-img"
                  />
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .portfolio-section {
    background-color: #080711;
    padding: 120px 0;
    position: relative;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
  }

  .section-header {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto 60px;
  }

  .section-title {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 38px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .gradient-text {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #06b6d4, #10b981);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Tabs Navigation Styling */
  .portfolio-tabs {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 50px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .tab-btn {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    color: #94a3b8;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .tab-btn:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    color: #ffffff;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .tab-btn.active {
    background: linear-gradient(
      135deg,
      rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15),
      rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.15)
    );
    border-color: #6366f1;
    color: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15);
  }

  .tab-icon {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
  }

  /* Content Toggling */
  .tab-content {
    display: none;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.5s ease-in-out;
  }

  .tab-content.active {
    display: block;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  /* TAB 1: WEBSITES PORTFOLIO */
  .websites-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 30px;
  }

  .web-portfolio-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .web-portfolio-card:hover {
    border-color: #10b981;
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.06);
  }

  .web-preview-header {
    height: 140px;
    padding: 30px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    position: relative;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
  }

  .web-preview-header.bandung {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #06b6d4);
  }
  .web-preview-header.jakarta {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7, #3b82f6);
  }
  .web-preview-header.biz {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b, #e11d48);
  }
  .web-preview-header.jelajah {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669, #4f46e5);
  }
  .web-preview-header.tekno {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5, #06b6d4);
  }

  .web-logo {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .web-logo .hl {
    background: #ffffff;
    color: #000000;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin-left: 2px;
  }

  .web-tag {
    align-self: flex-start;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    color: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  }

  .web-info {
    padding: 30px;
    flex-grow: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .web-info h3 {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .web-info p {
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .web-metrics {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    padding-top: 20px;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .web-metrics span {
    display: block;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #64748b;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .web-metrics strong {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* TAB 2: MOBILE APP DESIGN */
  .app-showcase-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .app-showcase-description h3 {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .desc-para {
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .desc-bullets {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .desc-bullet-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .bullet-check {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1);
    color: #06b6d4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 14px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .desc-bullet-item strong {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 15px;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .desc-bullet-item p {
    color: #64748b;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .app-simulation-control {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .app-simulation-control p {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #94a3b8;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .sim-btns {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .sim-btn {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    color: #94a3b8;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    border-radius: 6px;
